 can reproduce portrait mode cutting off the edges even in the current 4.7.1.stable.\r\nFor me it's different values, it works fine at 150% but 175% causes it to cut off:\r\n\r\n<details><summary>img</summary>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"360\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260724-100426\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/489c0c6c-e3b0-4b74-aa71-992dbb82be5c\" />\r\n\r\n</details> \r\n\r\nSo it's not caused by this PR I don't think.\r\n\r\n- Edit: Actually I'm probably just seeing https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118237 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5070786826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5073230002","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121387#issuecomment-5073230002","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121387","id":5073230002,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLmNYsg","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T18:35:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T18:35:08Z","body":"> I can reproduce portrait mode cutting off the edges even in the current 4.7.1.stable.\r\nFor me it's different values, it works fine at 150% but 175% causes it to cut off:\r\n\r\n@kitbdev This is a seperate issue. In case of script editor we know that it caused because the menubar's minimum width is too big for screen width and doesn't fit. That's why reducing the scale works there because minimum width reqirement also reduces.\r\n\r\nBut for Project Manager issue, it is not resizing even if it can fit in that space. Issue is reproducible for scale `1.72` but if I increase it to `1.75` it not reproducible anymore. Generally, increasing the scale should have made the cutoff even worse but it's somehow fixing it (this is not making any sense to me). I've explained it in http://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121726","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5073230002/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5073379061","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121387#issuecomment-5073379061","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121387","id":5073379061,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLmWe9Q","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerr